.TH SHB-DOCTOR 1 "October 2026" "SecretHarbor 0.4.0-prod" "SecretHarbor Manual"
.SH NAME
shb-doctor \- Run adversarial security verification test suite
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshb doctor\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Executes an 18-vector adversarial attack suite verifying that direct file reads, interpreter reads, symlinks, path traversals, file copies, renames, environment variables, privileged sockets, Docker socket access, container secret directories (/run/secrets), DOCKER_HOST leakage, inherited file descriptors, policy files, ptrace, core dumps, raw network egress, and filesystem escapes cannot be exploited by the agent.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
$ \fBshb doctor\fR
.SH SEE ALSO
shb(1)
.SH WEBSITE
https://secretharbor.dev
